  "actual_mathematical_results": {
    "n2_full_K_input": "For every finite nonempty original label set, complete formal sigma=(A,beta) and given rational pi, take uniform rho on any beta-cycle and Qbar(e_a)=(rho_a+1[a=A])/2. Root arcs carry rho_a, terminal arcs carry(rho_a+1[a=A])*pi_b; merge identical endpoints and remove self loops. div(lambda)=d+C-2Qbar*s with C=sum rho_a(delta(q_a,beta(a))-delta(q_a,a)). Full K kills the two-occupancy terms pairwise and all singleton terms by beta_*rho=rho. This gives one unconditional ALL step from the cycle theorem to the M47 method input, not a whole general method or duplicate W>=2v2 theorem. Qbar may use an A outside beta-image; C need not vanish in ordinary payoff space. Phi(e_a)=h_a and Phi(e_a+e_b)=h_a+h_b+J_ab explicitly provide the anonymous exact-potential deletion bridge including diagonals. Rational optimal queries are promised only for rational payoff matrices; all real-potential cases retain the given-rational-query scope. Existing p5 uniform-query certificate is an exact special case.",
    "qd_decoder_necessary_parameters": "The complete Q_D source has OPT=2-1/D and CONFIG1. The original private-tree v3 with d,h>=1 and per-full-state multiplicity mu has r=ceil(d/(mu+2)), b=d-mu(r-1)>=2r-1 and b^h>=2r^h-1, hence a complete original-job schedule Cprime<=2-r/d<2. Applying the decoder contract internal to the target theorem gives D*r<=d, d>=D, mu>=D-2. With mu<=mu0 obtain D*ceil(d/(mu0+2))<=d; D=mu0+2 requires D|d, only necessarily. Finite attained optima and OPTprime<2 give existence-only decoder iff OPT_D<=OPTprime. This is a whole unconditional implication theorem, not compiler existence or an algorithmic decoder.",
    "gated_value_bridge_step": "For all explicit normalized P_gate inputs without FSLP, whole-job forward and C<2 reverse mappings give OPT=2-beta*. Given any balanced witness v, all jobs admit C<=2-v, including b=0 baseline and all unused states/zero incidences. The source-only repair changes two endpoint pins and one full-file evidence SHA; mathematical contribution.result/remaining stay unchanged. General total welfare W>=5L/8 becomes a balanced v only through sorted scan: W<=n(2v-v^2), Wstar>=n(beta*)^2. The13/8 quadratic remainder is(209beta^2-468beta+260)/64>=1/64 on[0,1]. Target LP, exact two-stage CE, polynomial bit complexity and the remaining ratio proof are independently established in target materials, not paid by this STEP.",
    "other_ratio_packet_comparisons": "Retain11 cores5linked/6isolated: raw-to-fixed-row actualOPT/affine-localizer step; single-pin-to-palette actualOPT step; fixed-K/unique-home macro-promise one-sided unknownOPT search whole; separate VW global-big domain, affine marginal contracts, high-order positive cylinders, trimmed expected packing, common-all-core-law gap and strict heavy-alternative filter boundaries. Nonmonotone acceptance is compatible with lo<qstar and saved successful hi; successful threshold need not certify OPT<=T."
  },
